## Demo Winning Match Breakdowns (`v3` vs `amazon`)

The updated evaluation logs (`fingerprint 3952808220`) show that V3 solved the Amazon sustain wall not by out-chipping Amazon in prolonged neutral, but by **reading Amazon's `S+K`/`S+L` burst windows with `A`-stance guards** (`10.8%` usage on Bullet Ant, `12.6%` on Beetle) to bank `13–15` Chi and cash out multi-round `S`-move lethal chains before Amazon can regenerate.

* **The `A+K` Chi-Spike Trap (Bullet Ant Match #7; Beetle Matches #5 & #6):**
Three of the eight demo wins follow an identical, high-efficiency script. After trading early openers (`W+I`/`W+K` or `D+J` into `W+K`), V3 anticipates Amazon's Round 3 `S+K` (`70–91%` charge) and calls **`A+K` at `43–46%` charge**. Intercepting the heavy attack jumps V3's Chi to **`14–15`** while leaving Amazon dry at `1` Chi. On Bullet Ant Match #7 (`p1`, 8 rounds), this sets up a clean `S+I @ 98%` → `D+J @ 69%` → `W+K @ 41%` reset into a two-hit `S+L @ 88%` (`2,632 → 810 LP`) and `S+K @ 69%` (`810 → 0 LP`) finish. On Beetle Match #5 (`p1`, 7 rounds) and Match #6 (`p2`, 5 rounds), the R3 `A+K` battery triggers immediate back-to-back **`S+L @ 89–94%` → `S+J @ 92–98%**` finishers, erasing Amazon's full `2,700 LP` bar in two turns.
* **Deep-Deficit `A+L` Turnaround (Bullet Ant Match #3, `p1`, 17 Rounds):**
Down `876 LP` to Amazon's untouched `2,632 LP` on Round 13 with Faint dangerously high at `86`, V3 reads Amazon's `90%` `S+L` with **`A+L @ 34%`**, absorbing the hit and spiking Chi to **`13`**. That single defensive read flips the match economy: V3 chains three consecutive `S` bursts—`S+I @ 92%` (`2,632 → 1,212 LP`), `S+L @ 87%` (`1,212 → 76 LP`), and `S+J @ 97%`—before closing with `W+L @ 77%` (`76 → 0 LP`) while Amazon never recovers above `6` Chi.
* **Low-Round Speed Blitzes (Bullet Ant Match #6, `p2`, 4 Rounds & Beetle Match #1, `p1`, 5 Rounds):**
When V3 preserves opening Chi through low-commitment `W` buffs, it out-races Amazon's sustain entirely. In Bullet Ant Match #6, V3 absorbs back-to-back `S+K` strikes (`98%` and `63%`) during its `W+I @ 61%` / `W+K @ 35%` setup (`2,363 LP`, `9` Chi remaining), then lands **`S+L @ 98%` (`2,700 → 830 LP`) into `S+K @ 100%` (`830 → 0 LP`)** for a 4-round KO. In Beetle Match #1, V3 opens `W+I @ 59%` → `D+L @ 73%` (`12` Chi) → `W+K @ 30%`, then sweeps `2,498 → 358 → 0 LP` via **`S+I @ 100%` and `S+J @ 91%**` for a `3,150 LP` flawless victory.
* **Stun Lock & Attrition Survival (Bullet Ant Match #4, `p2`, 10 Rounds & Beetle Match #3, `p1`, 12 Rounds):**
In Bullet Ant Match #4, V3 controls the pace at `3,089 LP`, punishes Amazon's `W+K` with `S+L @ 76%` (`2,700 → 937 LP`), drops `S+K @ 99%` (`870 → 172 LP`), and uses `D+I @ 63%` on Round 9 to push Amazon's Faint to **`100`**, forcing a `DO_NOTHING` stun on Round 10 for an uncontested `S+L @ 92%` kill. In Beetle Match #3, after dropping to `996 LP` by Round 4, V3 stabilizes with disciplined `D`-stance rotation (`D+J` / `D+K` / `D+L` at `78–88%`) and an `A+K @ 32%` guard clash on Round 9, banking `11` Chi by Round 10 to close from `2,184 LP` (`S+I @ 82%` → `414 LP` → `S+J @ 97%` → `0 LP`).

