## Telemetry & Remaining Slot Notes

* **Economy & Defensive Shift vs. Amazon:** Across the 56 high-tier Amazon matches, V3 maintains a massive **`+5.55` to `+5.86` net Chi advantage** (`0.71–0.88` earned vs `0.90–0.98` spent per round), while `K`-stance `A` guards (`27/33` on Bullet Ant, `31/43` on Beetle) serve as V3's primary anti-`S` countermeasure. Forced `IDLE` recovery remains minimal (`3.3%` on Bullet Ant, `0.9%` on Beetle).
