The model cleared **4 out of 4 difficulty tiers** on aggregate—maintaining a **70.0% win rate** even at the highest difficulty (**Bullet Ant / Master**)—and passed **27 of 28** individual opponent-by-difficulty cells. Behavioral telemetry confirms that `005_005` operates as a disciplined **tempo-control and stun-conversion fighter**, combining balanced offensive pressure with strict Chi management under the `charge1-reset1` ruleset.

