### Official Evaluation Report — Kamen Rider Stronger (`007`)

**Build:** `v5-state256-action17` | **Patch:** `charge1-reset1` | **Policy:** `rider` (Deterministic, $\epsilon = 0$) | **Reward:** `standard`

With the targeted replacement evaluations completed for **Riderman (`004`)**, **Kamen Rider X (`005`)**, and **Kamen Rider Amazon (`006`)**, **Kamen Rider Stronger (`007`) achieves a positive win rate (`> 50%` / at least `53.3%`) on Bullet Ant (Master) difficulty against all 7 Showa Riders**. Across the 28 total rider-difficulty cells, **27 of 28 cells now sit at `≥ 53.3%` win rate**, with **Amazon (`006`) vs. Beetle (Defensive)** standing as the sole fractional holdout at **49.0% overall (`52.1%` non-draw)**.

